# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠  WARNING — read before extending the working-documents list above
#
# The assignment README names exactly two required artefacts:
#
#     "ER diagram should be provided."
#     "Swagger documentation should be provided."
#
# The ER diagram currently lives inside PLAN.md and docs/architecture/
# DATA-ARCHITECTURE.md, both of which are ignored above. Before submitting,
# EITHER extract the diagram to /docs/er-diagram.md (already whitelisted),
# OR embed it in README.md — otherwise a graded, explicitly-named deliverable
# is missing from the repository.
#
# A blanket `*.md` rule is deliberately NOT used here: it would also ignore
# README.md, which is the first and often only file a reviewer opens.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

